[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1]
Lost Outpost: Cliffhanger

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1_desc]
Our expedition team has discovered an outpost located on the cliff on the other side of the chasm. It looks like it has been abandoned for a long time and is not built by the Business Alliance.

Pegasi in our team observed the outpost from the outside and found that the support structure of the outpost is not enough to support any pony - to be precise, the outpost has no support structure at all apart from only a few stones and round logs. It seems that the ground below the outpost was not a cliff before.

Before we can explore the outpost, we need to reinforce the support structure, otherwise the outpost will collapse.

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1_o0]
Copy that

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1_TOOLTIP]
Initiate the §YLost Outpost§! events
Unlock decision: §YLost Outpost: Reinforce Foundations§!

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_2]
Lost Outpost: The Dome

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_2_desc]
After the support structure was reinforced, the expedition team successfully entered the outpost.

It has been a long time since anypony has taken care of this place. It is very messy everywhere, and even water is seeping out, flowing to the door and dripping into the cliff. There is a small door on the wall facing the mountain, but it is locked. Many documents are scattered on the ground, most of which have been infiltrated by water. A few undamaged documents are written in ancient pony characters, and a log is partially damaged but still valuable:

“... The earth ponies stopped giving us food, and the Commander sent us to explore the glacier. Here we found some buildings that seemed not to belong to ponies — this outpost. Initially, there were many documents in an unknown language, but we have now managed to translate them into pony language. The information inside is far more magical than we imagined. But we are running out of time, and we don’t have enough time to decipher these... Recently, the Commander sent several scientists, who seem to be studying something for war? He also asked us to dig a place in the mountains for research, which is annoying. Why not catch some earth ponies to dig... Oh on the sake of Pegasi, this will be the greatest discovery in history, if only we had more time... The monsters are coming, and the Commander asked us to destroy all the Andalusian materials and take away all the translated materials, but without earth ponies, we probably can’t carry them all... We have to abandon the outpost and all our research progress...”

The remaining part is unrecognizable. The diary mentions that research is being conducted here, which should refer to the locked door. Now there is only one room left, and water is seeping behind the door. What could be there?

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_2_o0]
TODO

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_3]
Lost Outpost: Research Log

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_3_desc]
It was a close call. As the door was opened, a stream of water rushed out, pushing the debris behind the door to the ground, triggering a chain reaction that caused the entire foundation to shake as if in an earthquake.

Fortunately, the support structure we reinforced was strong enough to prevent the outpost from collapsing. From the ruins inside the room, the research team found another log:
“... conflict broke out, many soldiers’ wings were injured, and Commander Hurricane sent us to develop a tool that would allow the wounded to return to the sky...”

The remaining part was damaged by water. The “research results” mentioned in the log should be inside the locked door, and the expedition team is cleaning the room to find the key.

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_3_o0]
Keep up the pace

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4]
Lost Outpost: The Fall

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4_desc]
It was a close call. As soon as the door was opened, a stream of water rushed out, and the debris behind the door fell to the ground with a loud thud, triggering a chain reaction that caused the entire foundation to shake violently as if in an earthquake.

Due to the lack of construction knowledge, the strength of the support structure could not withstand such a strong vibration, and the entire outpost fell into the cliff, taking the entire research team with it...

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4_o0]
Oh no...

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4_TOOLTIP]
End the §YLost Outpost§! events

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5]
Forgotten Outpost: The Key

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5_desc]
After clearing the room, the expedition team found an object that looks like a horn, as well as a log.

“... we are on the edge of success, but we need more power ... we were attacked, to ensure the safety of the research, a new door was installed in the outpost ... magic-driven, and the key is a unicorn horn? ... it’s getting colder and colder, we need to speed up the progress...”

A unicorn horn? Disgusting... At least we found the key. However, the horn is damaged and has lost its magic. To open the door, we must re-inject magic into it.

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5_o0]
Use the magic of wand

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5_o1]
Use the magic of unicorn

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6]
Lost Outpost: Overcharge

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6_desc]
The horn is now pluged into the keyhole, a team member from the team takes out a wand and injects magic into the horn...

The horn starts to glow, regaining its magic... then it starts to shake violently, emitting a blinding light. A laser beam shoots out from the tip of the horn, until it can no longer withstand the pressure, bursting into fragments like powder. The team members were originally looking forward to the door opening, but now they are grateful that the door did not open. The door became a barrier to protect them, separating the team members from the room. If the door were to open, the few beams of light that slipped out of the gap have already indicated the outcome they would have...

Without any hesitation, all the ponies rushed out of the door and escaped from the outpost. Soon after, there was a violent explosion inside the outpost, the entire outpost was destroyed, not even leaving any debris. Only a large hole, and the contaminated area told us that it once existed...

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6_o0]
What the heck was that?!

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6_TOOLTIP]
End the §YLost Outpost§! events

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7]
Lost Outpost: Iron Wings

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7_desc]
The horn is placed in the keyhole, and the unicorn in the team injects magic into the horn...

The horn begins to glow, restoring magic... Then, the horn begins to charge the gate. The gate opens, and the horn shatters. There are many magical instruments and blueprints in this room, all unexpectedly well-preserved. There is a log on the table:
“It’s too cold here, with blizzards every day. We have to evacuate. I heard that Commander Hurricane is planning to find a new place to settle down. There are no resources to support the outpost anymore, and our research efforts are in vain.”

Another log introduces their research efforts:
“This machine is designed based on the posture of birds when they spread their wings to glide. It is powered by magic, capable of high-speed flight, and can be armed for air-to-air or air-to-ground attacks. Because it is a machine that can carry ponies to fly, Commander Hurricane named it ‘airplane’.”

The design of the airplane is indeed novel. Unlike airships, it is faster and more maneuverable. Its blueprints will definitely promote our aerospace technology development.

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7_o0]
They invent, we benefit

[en.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7_TOOLTIP]
End the §YLost Outpost§! events

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1]
被遗忘的哨所：孤悬

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1_desc]
我们的科考队发现了一个哨所，它位于悬崖另一头的峭壁上，其外表看起来已经年久失修，确认不是商业联盟所建。

队伍中的天马事先观察了哨所外围，发现哨所的支撑结构不足以支持任意一只小马——准确来说，哨所根本没有支撑结构，而是几块石头，几根圆木搭的地基在苦苦支撑，似乎哨所下方从前并不是悬崖。

进行探索前，我们需要加固支撑结构，否则哨所会塌陷。

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1_o0]
收到

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_1_TOOLTIP]
开启§Y被遗忘的哨所§!事件链
解锁决议：§Y被遗忘的哨所§!：加固地基

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_2]
被遗忘的哨所：大厅

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_2_desc]
支撑结构加固完毕，科考队顺利进入哨所。

里面已经好久没有小马打理过了，到处都很杂乱，甚至还有水渗出，又流到门口滴入悬崖下。向着山体那面墙上有一个小门，不过锁上了。地上散落着许多文件，大部分已经被水渗透了。少数未受损的文件用古小马语作成，其中一篇日志部分受损，不过仍有部分价值：

“...陆马不给粮食了，司令派我们探索冰川。在这里我们发现了一些似乎不属于小马的建筑——这个哨所。最初这里有许多语言不明的资料，不过我们现在都努力翻译成了小马语。这里面的资料远比我们想象中更加神奇。但是我们时间快来不及了，我们没有足够的时间破译这些... 最近司令派了几个科学家，似乎是要研究什么东西用来打仗？还叫我们往山里挖个地方用来研究，真烦，为什么不抓几只陆马挖... 天呐，这将是有史以来最伟大的发现，时间再多一点... 那些怪物来了，司令让我们销毁所有安达卢西亚语资料，并带走所有的翻译资料，但是没有陆马我们大概率是驮不动它们的... 我们不得不放弃哨所和全部研究成果...”

余下的部分以难以辨认。日记中提到这里正在进行研究，指的应该就是那个上锁的门。现在剩下一个房间煤气，门后面在渗水，似乎有什么东西？

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_2_o0]
回收一下资料，然后开门吧。

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_3]
被遗忘的哨所：研发日志

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_3_desc]
万分惊险。那扇门一被打开，一道水流便冲了出来，门后面堵着的杂物“咚”地砸在地上，由此引发了连锁反应，整片地基如同地震般剧烈震动。

万幸我们加固的支撑结构足够稳固，不至于让哨所塌陷。从房内的废墟中，科考队找到了另一篇日志：
“...爆发冲突，许多士兵的翅膀受伤了，飓风司令派我们研发一种能让伤员重回天空的工具...”

余下部分因水浸而受损。日志中所记“研发成果”应在那扇上锁的门内，科考队正在清理房间，寻找钥匙。

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_3_o0]
加快速度

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4]
被遗忘的哨所：坠落

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4_desc]
万分惊险。那扇门一被打开，一道水流便冲了出来，门后面堵着的杂物“咚”地砸在地上，由此引发了连锁反应，整片地基如同地震般剧烈震动。

由于建筑技术不熟，支撑结构的强度无法撑住如此强度的震动，整个哨所坠入悬崖，连带着一整支科考队...

这里没有任何价值了。

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4_o0]
哦不...

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_4_TOOLTIP]
结束§Y被遗忘的哨所§!事件链

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5]
被遗忘的哨所：充能密钥

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5_desc]
房间清理完毕，科考队找到了一个疑似角的物件，以及一篇日志。

“...要成功了，但是需要动力 ...被袭击了，为保证研发安全，哨站新装了一扇门 ...魔法驱动，钥匙竟然用的是独角兽的角？ ...最近越来越冷，得加快进度...”

独角兽的角？真恶心... 至少我们找到钥匙了。不过那个角已经破损，失去了魔力。要打开大门，必须重新注入魔力。

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5_o0]
使用法杖魔法

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_5_o1]
使用独角兽魔法

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6]
被遗忘的哨所：过充能

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6_desc]
角被安放在了钥匙孔内，科考队员拿出法杖，对着角注入魔法...

角开始发光，恢复魔力...紧接着，它开始剧烈震动，发出刺眼的光。角的尖端射出一道激光，直到再也撑不住压力，爆裂成如同粉末的碎片。科考队员们原本期待着大门打开，可如今却庆幸大门没有打开。大门成了保护他们的防线，将队员们与那个房间分隔开来。倘若那大门打开，从夹缝溜出的几束光束已经说明了他们将会得到的结局...

没有任何犹豫，所有小马冲出了门口，逃出了哨所。不一会，哨所内发生了剧烈爆炸，整个哨所灰飞烟灭，甚至没有留下残骸，只有一个大洞，以及受污染的区域告诉我们它曾存在过...

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6_o0]
到底是什么东西？！

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_6_TOOLTIP]
结束§Y被遗忘的哨所§!事件链

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7]
被遗忘的哨所：钢铁羽翼

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7_desc]
角被安放在了钥匙孔内，队伍中的独角兽对着角注入魔法...

角开始发光，恢复魔力... 紧接着，角开始为大门充能。大门打开了，角也随之破裂。这个房间内有许多法器，以及许多蓝图，意外的保存完好。桌子上有一篇日志：
“这里实在是太冷了，天天都在刮暴风雪，我们不得不撤离。听说飓风司令已经打算找一片新的地方来定居，没有资源再支持哨站，我们的研究努力算是白费了。”

另一篇日志介绍了他们的研究努力：
“这个机器参考了鸟类展翅时的平飞姿态，运用魔法驱动，能以高速飞行，并装载武器，用以对空或对地攻击。因为其是能载小马飞行的机器，飓风司令亲自命名，将其称为‘飞机’。”

飞机的设计实在是新颖，与飞艇不同，它的速度更快，机动性更高。它的设计图纸肯定能促进我们航天方面的科技发展。

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7_o0]
前马种树，后马乘凉

[zh.EVENT_C08_ENIO_7_TOOLTIP]
获得§2飞机§!的图纸
结束§Y被遗忘的哨所§!事件链
